              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kweethĩwa, yĩla ũsumbĩ wa Leovoamu walũlũmĩlw’e, na eethĩwa na vinya, atia mĩao ya Yeova, na Isilaeli onthe vamwe nake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
